---
import { THEMES } from '../data/themes';
import { repoDoc } from '../data/links';

const langs = ['go', 'rust', 'typescript', 'python', 'c', 'c++', 'zig', 'lua', 'ruby', 'java', 'kotlin', 'swift', 'haskell', 'ocaml', 'elixir', 'sql', 'yaml', 'toml', 'nix', 'bash', 'protobuf', 'hcl'];
const servers = ['gopls', 'rust-analyzer', 'typescript-language-server', 'pyright · ruff', 'clangd', 'zls', 'lua-language-server', 'solargraph', 'jdtls', 'omnisharp', 'texlab'];
---

<section class="sec" id="features">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-id"><span class="sec-n">03</span><span>/features</span></div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="sec-title">Everything for reading. <em>Nothing else.</em></h2>
        <p class="sec-sub">
          The navigation and review tools you reach for a hundred times a day, done in milliseconds, in a UI that renders only
          the lines you can see.
        </p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="fgrid">
      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.01</b><span>navigate</span></div>
        <h3>Fuzzy everything</h3>
        <p>Files, symbols, and a full-tree regex scan behind three chords. Ranking favours basenames, word boundaries, and camelCase humps, the way fzf feels.</p>
        <div class="fviz keys">
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd">P</span><em>go to file</em><b>1.3 ms</b></div>
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd shift-key">Shift</span><span class="kbd">O</span><em>symbols</em><b></b></div>
          <div><span class="kbd mod-key">Ctrl</span><span class="kbd shift-key">Shift</span><span class="kbd">F</span><em>regex scan</em><b>26.8 ms</b></div>
          <small>timings: django, 7,014 files</small>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.02</b><span>git & diff</span></div>
        <h3>Status badges & visual diffs</h3>
        <p>Working-tree status badges (M, A, D, U) in the file tree, dirty ancestor paths, and a changed-only filter. Toggle side-by-side or unified diffs vs HEAD with Ctrl+D.</p>
        <div class="fviz git-diff">
          <div class="gd-tree">
            <span><i class="gt-dot"></i>web/src</span>
            <span class="badge-git badge-add">A markdown.js</span>
            <span class="badge-git badge-mod">M fuzzy.go</span>
          </div>
          <div class="diff-mini">
            <div class="dm-head"><span>fuzzy.go (diff vs HEAD)</span><span class="dm-tag">Ctrl+D</span></div>
            <div class="dm-row dm-del"><span class="dm-ln">64</span><span class="dm-tx">- score -= len(p) / 4</span></div>
            <div class="dm-row dm-add"><span class="dm-ln">64</span><span class="dm-tx">+ score -= len(p) / 8</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.03</b><span>batch agent edit</span></div>
        <h3>Batch inline agent editing</h3>
        <p>Stage multiple selection comments across files with Alt+E, review unified batch controls, and apply all edits at once with Mod+Enter. Live Git status sync highlights touched tabs instantly.</p>
        <div class="fviz agent-box">
          <div class="ab-batch-bar">
            <span class="ab-batch-badge">Batch Edit</span>
            <span class="ab-batch-count">2 comments</span>
            <span class="ab-batch-apply">Mod+Enter Apply All</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-head">
            <span class="ab-pill">claude</span>
            <span class="ab-model">haiku</span>
            <span class="ab-range">@fuzzy.go:64-70</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-in">"simplify score penalty calculation"</div>
          <div class="ab-head">
            <span class="ab-pill">claude</span>
            <span class="ab-model">haiku</span>
            <span class="ab-range">@status.go:18-22</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ab-in">"format batch elapsed timer"</div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.04</b><span>selection</span></div>
        <h3>Classic text & diff selection</h3>
        <p>Full Shift and Ctrl keyboard selection across lines, words, and pages. Select code inside side-by-side or unified diffs, right-click for instant actions, or copy standardized @path:l1-l2 snippets.</p>
        <div class="fviz sel-demo">
          <div class="sel-row"><span class="sel-ln">182</span><span class="sel-tx sel-hi">func diffSelection(sel) Range &#123;</span></div>
          <div class="sel-row"><span class="sel-ln">183</span><span class="sel-tx sel-hi">  return anchorWorkingTree(sel)</span></div>
          <div class="sel-acts">
            <span>Alt+C copy ref</span>
            <span>Alt+A copy for agent</span>
            <span class="sel-act-hi">Alt+E edit</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.05</b><span>markdown & images</span></div>
        <h3>Rendered GFM & image tabs</h3>
        <p>Full GitHub Flavored Markdown with syntax-highlighted code fences and bi-directional scroll sync. Inspect images with zoom/pan, contrast modes (b), pixelated toggle (p), and lightbox.</p>
        <div class="fviz md-prev">
          <div class="md-bar">
            <span class="md-pill on">Preview</span><span class="md-pill">Source</span>
            <span class="md-pill">Image Tab</span>
            <span class="md-key"><span class="kbd alt-key">Alt</span><span class="kbd">M</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="md-box">
            <div class="md-h"># Architecture Deep Dive</div>
            <p class="md-p">Windowed tokenizing with Chroma...</p>
            <div class="md-img-badge"><span class="md-badge-icon">🖼</span><span>icon.svg · 512×512 px [b: checker | p: pixelated]</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.06</b><span>render</span></div>
        <h3>Virtual rows</h3>
        <p>Opening a 400,000-line file costs the same as a 10-line one. Only the visible window plus 24 rows of overscan is mounted; scrolling recycles rows with a single transform.</p>
        <div class="fviz vr">
          <div class="vr-file" aria-hidden="true"><span class="vr-win"></span></div>
          <div class="vr-k">
            <span><b>400,000</b> lines in file</span>
            <span><b>~60</b> DOM rows</span>
            <span><b>0.015%</b> mounted</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.07</b><span>highlight</span></div>
        <h3>~280 languages</h3>
        <p>Native tokenizing through Chroma. The server lexes a 1,000-line window padded with 400 lines of context, never the whole file, and caches rendered HTML under a 512 MB LRU budget.</p>
        <div class="fviz chips">
          {langs.map((l) => <span class="chip">{l}</span>)}
          <span class="chip chip--more">+ ~258</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.08</b><span>lsp · optional</span></div>
        <h3>Semantic when you want it</h3>
        <p>Zero-config detection on $PATH and standard binary folders. Spawned lazily on first request, stopped on exit. Click the status bar hint for automatic installation recipes.</p>
        <ul class="fviz srv">
          {servers.map((s) => <li><i></i>{s}</li>)}
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.09</b><span>remote</span></div>
        <h3>Remote-first & zero SSH</h3>
        <p>Spin up on cloud VMs, Docker containers, or CI runners with -host 0.0.0.0. Browse in your local browser over Tailscale or WireGuard with zero remote extension daemons and strict DNS rebinding checks.</p>
        <pre class="fviz tty"><span class="s-warn">$</span> px0 -host 0.0.0.0 -port 7777 ~/work
<span class="s-dim">listening on:</span> <span class="s-ok">http://10.0.4.12:7777</span>
<span class="s-dim">sandboxing:</span>   <span class="s-ok">path traversal + DNS guards</span></pre>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.10</b><span>themes</span></div>
        <h3>14 built in</h3>
        <p>Tokyo Night by default, plus Paper, Catppuccin, Dracula, GitHub Dark, Gruvbox, Monokai, Nord, One Dark, Rose Pine, and Solarized. A theme is one CSS file of tokens.</p>
        <div class="fviz swatches">
          {THEMES.map((t) => (
            <span class="swatch" title={t.name} style={`--a:${t.vars.bg};--b:${t.vars.k};--c:${t.vars.s};--d:${t.vars.nf}`}></span>
          ))}
          <a href={repoDoc('docs/internals/styling-and-themes.md')} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">write your own: STYLING.md</a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.11</b><span>distribution</span></div>
        <h3>One static binary</h3>
        <p>HTML, CSS, and JS are embedded with <code class="inline-code">go:embed</code>. No Electron, no Node, no CGO, no system libraries. Copy it to a box and run it.</p>
        <pre class="fviz tree"><span class="s-warn">px0</span> <span class="s-dim">static, go:embed</span>
├─ index · search · highlight · lsp · agent
├─ web/     <span class="s-dim">html css js, ~74 KB</span>
└─ themes/  <span class="s-dim">14 × css</span></pre>
      </article>

      <article class="fcell reveal">
        <div class="fid"><b>f.12</b><span>memory</span></div>
        <h3>Gives memory back</h3>
        <p>After 15 seconds without requests, px0 automatically frees memory back to the kernel. A tab left open for the afternoon costs what an idle one should.</p>
        <div class="fviz scav">
          <div><span>peak</span><i style="width:94%"></i><b>94 MB</b></div>
          <div class="hi"><span>30 s idle</span><i style="width:57%"></i><b>57 MB</b></div>
          <small>linux kernel, after five full scans</small>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .fgrid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--bdr);
  }

  .fcell {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    min-height: 300px;
    padding: 20px 20px 22px;
    background: var(--bg);
    transition: background-color 0.2s;
  }

  .fcell:hover {
    background: var(--bg-elev);
  }

  .fid {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .fid b {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .fcell h3 {
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .fcell p {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .fviz {
    margin-top: auto;
    padding-top: 10px;
  }

  /* keys */
  .keys div {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 4px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr);
  }

  .keys em {
    margin-left: 8px;
    font-style: normal;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .keys b {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .keys small,
  .scav small {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 6px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  /* git & diff visualizer */
  .git-diff {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .gd-tree {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .gt-dot {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--amber);
    margin-right: 4px;
  }

  .badge-git {
    font-size: 9.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .badge-add {
    color: var(--green);
    background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.15);
  }

  .badge-mod {
    color: var(--amber);
    background: var(--amber-wash);
  }

  .diff-mini {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
  }

  .dm-head {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    color: var(--txt-3);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .dm-tag {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-line);
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .dm-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .dm-ln {
    color: var(--txt-4);
    width: 2ch;
    text-align: right;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .dm-tx {
    white-space: pre;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
  }

  .dm-del {
    background: rgba(248, 81, 73, 0.12);
    color: var(--rose);
  }

  .dm-add {
    background: rgba(46, 160, 67, 0.12);
    color: var(--green);
  }

  /* agent box */
  .agent-box {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .ab-batch-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 3px 8px;
    background: var(--bg-card);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--amber-line);
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .ab-batch-badge {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ab-batch-count {
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .ab-batch-apply {
    margin-left: auto;
    background: var(--amber);
    color: var(--bg);
    font-size: 8.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 1px 5px;
    border-radius: 2px;
  }

  .ab-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    font-size: 10px;
  }

  .ab-pill {
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-line);
    background: var(--amber-wash);
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .ab-model {
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .ab-range {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--txt-3);
    font-size: 9.5px;
  }

  .ab-in {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt);
    font-style: italic;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  .ab-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    font-size: 10px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .ab-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--green);
    box-shadow: 0 0 6px var(--green);
  }

  .ab-tag {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: var(--amber);
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-line);
    padding: 0 4px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* selection demo */
  .sel-demo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }

  .sel-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .sel-ln {
    color: var(--txt-4);
    width: 3ch;
    text-align: right;
    user-select: none;
  }

  .sel-tx {
    white-space: pre;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .sel-hi {
    background: var(--amber-wash);
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .sel-acts {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .sel-act-hi {
    color: var(--amber);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* markdown preview */
  .md-prev {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
  }

  .md-bar {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--bg-elev);
  }

  .md-pill {
    font-size: 10px;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .md-pill.on {
    background: var(--amber-wash);
    color: var(--amber);
    border: 1px solid var(--amber-line);
  }

  .md-key {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .md-box {
    padding: 8px 10px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .md-h {
    font-size: 11.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  .md-p {
    font-size: 11px !important;
    color: var(--txt-3) !important;
    line-height: 1.4 !important;
  }

  .md-code {
    padding: 4px 6px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--cyan);
    font-size: 10.5px;
  }

  .md-img-badge {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    background: var(--bg-elev);
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 9.5px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  /* chips */
  .chips {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .chip--more {
    color: var(--amber);
    border-color: var(--amber-line);
  }

  /* virtual rows */
  .vr-file {
    position: relative;
    height: 30px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr-hi);
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, var(--track) 0 1px, transparent 1px 4px);
  }

  .vr-win {
    position: absolute;
    top: -5px;
    bottom: -5px;
    left: 38%;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--amber);
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--amber-glow);
  }

  .vr-k {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 12px;
    margin-top: 10px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .vr-k b {
    color: var(--txt);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  /* lsp list */
  .srv {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 3px 12px;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-2);
  }

  .srv li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    min-width: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-overflow: ellipsis;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .srv i {
    width: 5px;
    height: 5px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: var(--green);
  }

  /* swatches */
  .swatches {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 4px;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .swatch {
    width: 26px;
    height: 26px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(var(--b), var(--b)) 6px 7px / 12px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(var(--c), var(--c)) 6px 12px / 8px 2px no-repeat,
      linear-gradient(var(--d), var(--d)) 6px 17px / 14px 2px no-repeat,
      var(--a);
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.3);
  }

  .swatches a {
    flex-basis: 100%;
    margin-top: 8px;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--amber);
  }

  .swatches a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* pre blocks */
  .tree,
  .tty {
    padding: 10px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bdr);
    background: var(--code-bg);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--txt-2);
    white-space: pre;
    overflow-x: auto;
  }

  /* scavenger */
  .scav div {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 70px minmax(0, 1fr) 52px;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    padding: 4px 0;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--txt-3);
  }

  .scav i {
    display: block;
    height: 10px;
    background: var(--bar-muted);
  }

  .scav .hi i {
    background: var(--bar);
  }

  .scav b {
    text-align: right;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--txt);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1040px) {
    .fgrid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .fgrid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .fcell { min-height: 0; }
    .srv { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
  }
</style>
